<title>UK: UBS ups convertible bond to $325 mln.</title>
<headline>UBS ups convertible bond to $325 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following convertible bond has been priced and increased to $325 million from $250 million, lead manager UBS Ltd said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   UNION BANK OF SWITZERLAND</p>
<p> AMT	  $325 MLN  COUPON     2.75	MATURITY    16.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE    CONVERTIBLE  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    16.JUN.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AA+   LISTING    LUX	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> PREMIUM    23 PCT    CNV PRICE  1,845 CHF</p>
<p> FOREX FIX  1.43 SFR/US$</p>
<p> NOTES	CALLABLE AFTER TWO YEARS SUBJECT TO 130 PCT HURDLE.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
